          "eyebrow": "Overview",
          "heading": "Small workouts, built into real routines",
          "summary": "Pulse began as a 12-week training plan that most people abandoned by week two. We reframed it around tiny daily habits, adaptive sessions and forgiving streaks. I owned research, flows and the visual language from first sketch to App Store launch.",
          "meta": [
            { "label": "Role", "value": "Product Designer" },
            { "label": "Timeline", "value": "12 weeks" },
            { "label": "Platform", "value": "iOS & Android" },
